[{"type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"\u003c@U022XK5866Q\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1622465986.207500","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"9b3b70ac-05af-4492-b1b0-8ab69fd76584","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"んーどうしたらよいかわからない。ネットワークアダプタのパブリック or プライベート属性を設定する方法が。","ts":"1622447691.206200","thread_ts":"1622447691.206200","reply_count":3,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ocX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"080b1ccb-d1cd-44f2-8e92-bb5d96609dd1","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"あ、そういうことか。wsl の linux からproxy に繋がらないのは。ぐぬぬ。違った","ts":"1622446926.205100","thread_ts":"1622446926.205100","edited":{"user":"U013QL1RAPN","ts":"1622447453.000000"},"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"du/PV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0d129826-8bae-4779-8c10-64fcefc0a3f5","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"いま確認しててわかったんだけども、WSL2の中から素Windowsで動いているサービスにアクセスするには、Windows Defenderファイアーウォールでそのプロセスに対してパブリックネットワークのアクセスを付けなきゃいけないみたい。つまりWSL2向けのネットワークアダプタがパブリック設定になってるってことだとは思うけども…","ts":"1622446372.204900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BLohO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0cc9772a-97e7-4709-be07-49a1530cdf10","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"POSIXがあるから…(震え声","ts":"1622444781.203500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T0R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0a6db6f9-0db9-48eb-a4bb-3916682f6014","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"シェルスクリプト、まさにこれなんですよね\n\u003chttps://xkcd.com/927/\u003e","ts":"1622444576.202900","attachments":[{"fallback":"xkcd: Standards","id":1,"author_name":"xkcd","author_link":"https://xkcd.com/","title":"Standards","title_link":"https://xkcd.com/927/","text":"[Title text] \"Fortunately, the charging one has been solved now that we've all standardized on mini-USB. Or is it micro-USB? Shit.\"","image_url":"https://imgs.xkcd.com/comics/standards.png","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/xkcd.png","original_url":"https://xkcd.com/927/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DdwP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"94054c0d-7f63-44a5-829c-014d2e51be49","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"でも引数そえて PowerShell でパイプはわりとちゃんとしてる感じはするし\nみんなシェルスクリプト複雑化させるから、スクリプト側で強いという判断はアリな気はする(それが好まれるかは別)","ts":"1622444354.202500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bQPF7"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"\u003c@U7JL1UKKL\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1622444344.202100","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"cfaaa049-d9c1-436e-8c4f-e29c4f727394","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/xonsh/xonsh\u003e …","ts":"1622440974.200900","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: xonsh/xonsh","id":1,"title":"xonsh/xonsh","title_link":"https://github.com/xonsh/xonsh","text":":shell: Python-powered, cross-platform, Unix-gazing shell - xonsh/xonsh","image_url":"https://repository-images.githubusercontent.com/29620400/8c0c2880-04b9-11eb-82dd-7130e57967e2","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/xonsh/xonsh","original_url":"https://github.com/xonsh/xonsh"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hai-small","count":1,"users":["UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pBz9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1ca3af1f-a2aa-4f3e-a63c-a1c8e2b5ec37","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"そうですね そのへんのラッピングになにか欲しいですね","ts":"1622440588.200600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BhND3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d86c8735-0cf6-464a-aafd-1de823828340","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ほぼほぼ irb では。そこにコマンド実行するためになんかできないんだろうか?","ts":"1622440503.200100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yG+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7526afaa-2735-4638-bc74-1be6a4f9fe88","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"確かに Ruby製のシェル使ってみたい","ts":"1622440395.199100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"F9a"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6c883287-0de1-4c15-b4e7-2a6544a7452d","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"Ruby なんかはインタラクティブシェルに向いてると思う。","ts":"1622440012.198700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U7CJ2P52B"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"S=7tU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"32036fd5-e7bb-453a-b69c-0ee34c0d9f24","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"それをインタラクティブシェルにしてしまおうって所が無理筋すぎて...","ts":"1622439454.197700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"gunnyari","count":2,"users":["UKHUVMBJR","U8CC7MDCL"]},{"name":"grin","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"My5jG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cb270584-68d0-4d1a-a857-1dc954009201","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"COM使いやすいスクリプト、ですね。","ts":"1622439315.197200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pL/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e0a12ce0-b8ac-45c8-bb6e-bd32d43e4e5d","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"```$listener = New-Object Net.HttpListener\n$listener.Prefixes.Add(\"\u003chttp://localhost:8000/\u003e\")\ntry {\n    $listener.Start()\n    while ($true) {\n        $context = $listener.GetContext()\n        $response = $context.Response\n        $content = [System.Text.Encoding]::UTF8.GetBytes('hello world!')\n        $response.OutputStream.Write($content, 0, $content.Length)\n        $response.Close()\n    }\n}\ncatch {\n    Write-Error($_.Exception)\n}```\nこうやって見ると、PowerShell って普通に言語なんだなって思う…\nシェルじゃない…","ts":"1622439176.196800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dyA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d1bd02cb-2cc7-4893-a2ee-69fdc3e2ca9c","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"PATH からなくなるだけなので、フルパスなら動きますね","ts":"1622437889.196100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6VnRa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f57588b2-38f0-4163-9a75-fbd45e9cfa27","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"appendWindowsPathをfalseにしてenabledをtrueにすればexeは動くけどWindowsのPATHは追加しないになるので、\nフルパス指定すればexe動くようには出来ますね\n```[interop]\nenabled=true\nappendWindowsPath=false```","ts":"1622437858.195800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tips","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rCh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4b65cd7e-6980-489d-8c56-655bd5cf3d3d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"appendWindowsPath = false している時に別途 Windows の PATH を取る方法はあるのかな","ts":"1622437853.195600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i3j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"11da1a61-d996-4754-852d-1614cc255a16","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"`/mnt/c/Windows/System32` とか一部だけ手動で追加するのもありかも","ts":"1622437777.194000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vfcF9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b5530036-02f9-4e32-83e7-676501cb165d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`.exe` だったら Windows のパスも探す、とかになってると嬉しいんだが","ts":"1622437664.193500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ndlf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9972495e-4dd6-47a4-9923-351b4e466d9e","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"clip.exe とか explorer.exe とかは使うなぁ。","ts":"1622437663.193400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pS50"}]},{"client_msg_id":"235a1621-09e1-47f2-a377-f4c7b2d91c5f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`xdg-open` の実装に使っている","ts":"1622437544.191900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MFU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d72eb30b-8ad7-4ad6-b164-05485a2841d2","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"あ、そうか。cmd.exe も動かなくなっちゃうか。スクリプトから指定しているので、フルパス指定するようにするか","ts":"1622437523.191600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w+4Vt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8290A49C-1816-4494-9B70-3803ABF63875","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"うぉ、知見。ぼくも切ろ。個人的にwslで一番キモいと思ってた部分なので。オフれるんですね","ts":"1622437464.191100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nZIa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6aa82adc-f099-4c66-b2f5-1bd307ff08fe","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"clip.exeとかcmdとか起動しなければoffで良さそうですよね\n私も切ってる","ts":"1622437424.189800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XBL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ead9b4f4-daf1-4f4a-a932-526f09bacdf0","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"特に configure とか。","ts":"1622437231.188400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8qAUE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2da16246-8665-42c4-86a8-d9c80c1bac36","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"結構パフォーマンス変わったのを覚えてます。","ts":"1622437221.188200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vnh0M"}]},{"client_msg_id":"afff9a3a-de99-47ab-902a-30929544720d","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"どっちだったかわすれましたが、append って所を見ると Windows の方が後だと思います。","ts":"1622437196.187900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Binr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f23db5c9-994e-4b42-9e9f-9fe0ab1cc038","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"私もそれ切ってみよ","ts":"1622437093.187400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"08soA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"65c72fa1-9b4f-4099-b9c6-15534295e10a","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"じゃあ、例えばWindowsとWSLに同一のソフトが入っていると仮定したとき、実行されるパス優先順位ってWSL→Windowsってことであってますか?","ts":"1622436935.186800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Lrzz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"edf5d4d0-c50b-4c52-b55b-ede1055b17d8","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"基本、いらんと思ってるので僕はオフってます。","ts":"1622436850.185200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":2,"users":["U01AQ5BFNLX","U013QL1RAPN"]},{"name":"me-too","count":2,"users":["U8CC7MDCL","U01D44KSY9Z"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yN0ND"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9376f2db-0aad-44cd-8d98-38e32838399a","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"なるほど、Windowsの$PATHも参照するのか","ts":"1622436816.184500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TkSbM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"396017a0-9d0c-4def-9696-3b2a75c72328","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"実行ファイルの検索に時間が掛かるんですよね。その分。","ts":"1622436752.183900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lmu1E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"768f8d46-032a-4038-973c-9b3cd5295430","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"いえ、WSL って notepad コマンド実行すると Windows の notepad.exe が起動するんです。なので\n```$ echo $PATH```\nってすると Windows の実行パスが追加されるのが分かると思います。","ts":"1622436740.183600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5HT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c2f7d24d-7986-4f96-83bc-0a114460cbab","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"だいぶチューニングできた\n`261.631  000.002: --- NVIM STARTED ---`","ts":"1622436466.182700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+8Td"}]},{"client_msg_id":"91689f9c-9156-497e-8073-bb6f87aeb994","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"windowsのパスを追加するということは\nたとえば、`/home/hasu` が、 `windowsから見た /home/までのパス + /home/hasu` になるという認識であってますか？","ts":"1622436425.182000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cSo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2c649ab3-efca-430e-97aa-d51439c37064","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"なるほど！知らなかった。ありがとうございます","ts":"1622436297.179700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0A0V3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7389542d-1bfe-47d3-a43e-40b1575a46b0","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"WSL が遅くなる理由の1つに、Windows の PATH を足してしまってるのでコマンド実行が遅くなるというのがあります。vimrc から git コマンドを使ったりしてる場合、それ自体が遅くなる事がある。","ts":"1622435826.179400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MTNEu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fc73dde1-d1c2-4ca8-af0b-c6a71c85cb85","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"```$ cat /etc/wsl.conf\n[network]\ngenerateHosts = false\n\n[automount]\noptions = \"metadata\"\n\n[interop]\nappendWindowsPath = false```","ts":"1622435773.178500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_