text","block_id":"Ox6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e0f5b1da-f372-4919-b6e4-b7ca236ed787","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"普通のHTTPサーバとかは同じ構成(Winでサーバ動かしてWSL2からアクセス)で動きます?","ts":"1622431211.149500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uiL9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c04f924b-fccc-4c72-b3e5-3a6026ae2408","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"WSL2 内で lemonade server を起動することもできるし、クリップボードにもアクセスはできるっぽいのだけど、マルチバイト文字がなぜか文字化けする…","ts":"1622431181.149200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uyx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2c8fdda7-4ca3-4c91-8277-9f26f76dc775","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ああなるほど","ts":"1622431159.148400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Dkja"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ccb0185c-90bd-4532-a447-64334dcc2890","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"逆ですね。lemonade はクリップボードを扱うので、lemonade server を Win ホスト側で動かして、これに WSL2 側から繋ぎたいのだけど、うまく行かない","ts":"1622431147.148200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yntC="}]},{"client_msg_id":"f92103a3-db63-47e9-9cec-62224a876c9c","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"WSL2の中で動かして、Winから繋ぐって構成でハマってるんでしたっけ?","ts":"1622431046.147100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p+Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2167becd-6b5b-4884-9ac4-37a7982d6bd1","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Docker Desktop で立ち上げたコンテナには繋がってるしとりあえずいっか、ってなってる。困ってるのは lemonade くらいか…","ts":"1622430991.146600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PEF3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6ff75527-0905-4021-b8f4-6d8a1129b1ea","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"1と2でまったく事情違うからね～","ts":"1622430966.146100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y6TL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"55f60bb7-842f-43b3-8f67-0812f9705985","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"WSL のネットワーク未だに何もわかってない","ts":"1622430946.145600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U3oi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6c1d8ff2-41da-4423-a7c1-d1388ec71bf3","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"なるほど。普段生活する環境を想定していたので、やっぱりWSLになるかなぁ","ts":"1622430883.144900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a1UUu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9320b7c6-678a-4d59-a32e-f8fb0059d2ec","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"WSL2のネットワークのわかりにくさはWin側のネットワークとの透過性の観点なんだけど、本質的にHyper-Vでブリッジが入ってさらにFirewallが入るってことを知らない\u0026amp;わかりにくいが故だと考えてます。","ts":"1622430602.143700","thread_ts":"1622430449.143300","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HVsb"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"e4365352-9e39-431c-875d-ae9e6438aece","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"適当にアプリ走らせるだけならDocker Desktopがベストかなぁ。\n\n普段生活するなら恐らくHyper-Vが最も安定するけど、Winとのインタラクションが弱い。\n\nWSL1はお手軽だけど再現度・忠実度が低い。\n\nWSL2はWSL1と同等のお手軽さで忠実度は上がってるけど…ネットワークの透過性がむしろ分かりにくくなってる。","ts":"1622430449.143300","thread_ts":"1622430449.143300","reply_count":2,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HiP"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"3e64409c-91d4-45cd-948b-0b1ee8e9141f","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あとは何を重視するか、よ。","ts":"1622430479.143600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nR1Qd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e4365352-9e39-431c-875d-ae9e6438aece","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"適当にアプリ走らせるだけならDocker Desktopがベストかなぁ。\n\n普段生活するなら恐らくHyper-Vが最も安定するけど、Winとのインタラクションが弱い。\n\nWSL1はお手軽だけど再現度・忠実度が低い。\n\nWSL2はWSL1と同等のお手軽さで忠実度は上がってるけど…ネットワークの透過性がむしろ分かりにくくなってる。","ts":"1622430449.143300","thread_ts":"1622430449.143300","reply_count":2,"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tips","count":1,"users":["U01AQ5BFNLX"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HiP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d4eadb81-4fec-4362-816d-f20a817cc75f","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"Linux環境って自分が普段生活する作業環境?","ts":"1622430243.140300","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1622430252.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vjnYG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d22a729e-db7d-42bf-946c-6fee0e081098","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"vagrantでもいいんだけど、vagrantはちょっとしたことですぐ起動しなくなるのでそれが辛い","ts":"1622430166.139900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xUnO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"432859a5-edf4-483d-ac28-3030fa5215e3","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"今windowsでLinux環境作るとしたら何がベターなんですかね","ts":"1622430138.139300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"no2a="}]},{"client_msg_id":"cc6f455e-5c2f-4eb8-8551-4d6dd63d83c4","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"なるほど","ts":"1622430119.138900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gvmk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"104dfa6c-7025-414f-8517-33cac4f3d929","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Plan9意外と存在感ある","ts":"1622429262.138600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"32f5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"007c68e2-6f8e-47f6-b78d-558853b1b271","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"WSL上のファイルにWin32側からアクセスできるようにするために使っているのが9Pですね。\nWSLからNTFSにアクセスするのはlxfsとかいう専用のfilesystemを使ってます。","ts":"1622423277.136800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":f